  "body": "If you are looking for your brand new home that has a view, space for all, and privacy then look no further than this well designed home. \r\nAs everyone knows, land is where the value lies and with 786sqm of land, you are in a perfect position. This sunny, 4 bedroom home has something for everyone with 2x master bedrooms with ensuites, 3x living areas, butlers pantry, bush views and so much more.\r\n\r\nA few highlighting features of this lovely home:\r\n*  Large section of 786sqm - Great space for kids to run around, or perhaps a pool or spa pool or even a trampoline\r\n*  2x Master bedrooms - great for guest, family or growing families\r\n*  3x Fully tiled bathrooms\r\n*  Guest toilet on entry\r\n*  3x Spacious living areas\r\n*  Large designer kitchen\r\n*  Walk-in pantry\r\n* * and so much more . . .\r\n\r\nAra Hills is excellently located directly off the Orewa Interchange on State Highway 1 giving access to travelling north or south being a full interchange and only 26min (approx.) from Auckland CBD. Ara Hills is an exceptional village based community of around 575 homes on around 84 ha of rolling hill country AND backs onto the Nukumea Reserve.\r\n\r\nFor more info contact Shaun Burnett 021 871 252 (email: shaun.burnett@raywhite.com), Meghan Sutton 021 556 623 (email: meghan.sutton@raywhite.com) or Stephen Burnett 021 957 021 (email: stephen.burnett@raywhite.com)",
